      "writtenOn": "2025-01-09T23:05:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That way, we can add any test with any properties, without the need to re-add what we assume is a correct value in the \"all\" section.\n\n\nAnd for now, you are only supporting boolean sysprop, but sysprop are string and they could theoretically be any value, but I am very fine limiting that to boolean value for now I feel like this would be kinda dangerous to allow any property override here",
