      "message": "I wanted to avoid having some test specific sysprops enabled under the mask - but to put all that\u0027s configured visible in the XML config. I think it\u0027s good to have it clearly stated in one place.\n\nAbout boolean - yeah, for now I think it should be sufficient, good we don\u0027t have too much sysprops to toggle",
